1.2.0
	* Add AVX-512 bitslice backend (512 packets in parallel)
	* Add native SWAP32 transpose for SSE and AVX2
	* Prefetch next packet data during batch loading
	* Remove dead code in AVX2 SBOX permute
	* Add pkg-config support with bitslice backend info
	* Auto-detect NEON on AArch64 hosts

1.1.0
	* Optimization of key schedule
